    sections: [
      {
        type: 'about',
        tabLabel: 'About',
        pages: [
          {
            title: 'Stovkahra',
            subtitle: 'Card Game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Stovkahra (Slovak: 'Hundred Game' or 'Hundreth') is a trick-taking card game for 4 players in fixed partnerships. It is played with a 32-card German or French-suited deck (7-Ace). The goal is to reach 100 points first by winning point cards (Ace, Ten, King, Queen, Jack) and melding combinations.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Trappola originated in Venice (Cardano, 1564) and spread to Central Europe, where it developed many variations. Stovkahra (Brčko) is a surviving form played in the Czech village of Šumice in Romania's Banát region. Researched by Tomáš Svoboda in 1997 and published in The Playing-Card; it retains Trappola point values and bonuses using a German 32-card pack after original Trappola cards ceased production in 1944.",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '4 (Partners sit opposite).',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'German suited 32-card pack (7 to Ace); eight cards each in 3-2-3 packets; bottom card shown for trump.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'German suited 32-card pack (7 to Ace); eight cards each in 3-2-3 packets; bottom card shown for trump.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Deal 8 cards each (4-4 or 3-2-3). Last card turned for Trump.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Variations',
            subtitle: 'Known ways this game changes',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'list',
                style: 'unordered',
                items: [
                  {
                    text: 'Play to 20 brček: When a team reaches 10 brček, continue the series to 20. If the first team to 10 also reaches 20 first they win two series; if the other team reaches 20 first the result is a draw.',
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
